Final product definition
SkyNex AI is successful for Round 2 when a judge can submit or upload supported content, see accurate and explainable findings grounded in approved brand knowledge, review a targeted correction, make a human decision, and see that decision persist. The recurrence alert is the next layer of value: it turns saved findings into a signal managers can investigate. Everything else is secondary until that path is reliable.